{{Term/Store|Mighty Thistle|Mighty Thistles|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Mighty Thistle}}
Mighty Thistles can be found growing in the [[Faron Grasslands]] and [[West Necluda]]. Many Mighty Thistles grow around [[Kaysa's Great Fairy Fountain]] near the [[Tabantha Tower]]. When Mighty Thistles are used while making a [[Meal]] in a [[Cooking Pot]], the resulting dish will grant [[Link]] [[Attack Up]] when eaten, which increases the damage of his attacks. Mighty Thistles that make contact with [[Fire]] turn into [[Roasted Mighty Thistle]]s. At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], Mighty Thistles can be used to create Orange [[Dye]].

